# Debugging the billing API

Use the staging token from the vault, then:

```bash
export BILLING_TOKEN=⟦TOKEN:{{ghpat:61}}⟧
curl -s -H "Authorization: Bearer $BILLING_TOKEN" https://billing.example.com/v1/invoices
curl -s -u admin:⟦PASSWORD:Staging#Pw77⟧ https://billing.example.com/health
curl -s "https://billing.example.com/export?format=csv&api_key=⟦API_KEY:{{rand:32:62}}⟧"
```

Response headers looked like this:

```http
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Set-Cookie: session_id=⟦COOKIE:{{rand:32:63}}⟧; Path=/; HttpOnly
X-Request-Id: {{uuid:64}}
Content-Type: application/json
```

Notes:
- the `api_key` parameter is deprecated, use the `Authorization` header instead
- see commit {{hex:40:65}} for the change; build 4.2.1
- contact ⟦EMAIL:dana.ruiz@globex-corp.net⟧ if the token expired
